# .codex SECTION — Emerald Empire: Strongholds of Power (Chapter 1 — governance).
# Stand-off graph over l5r5e-0.4-emerald-empire-governance.lore (spec §25). Part
# of the L5R5e system graph. Built in batches (this file grows as the chapter is
# folded in). Batch 1: the framing fiction, Unicorn castles, court institutions,
# Rokugani court titles, and the artisan's Fortunes. Batch 2: the eleven remaining
# Hours of Rokugan, gempuku, the named castles/palaces (Shiro Mirumoto, Pale Oak,
# Shiro Ide, Kyūden Togashi/Hida/Bayushi/Doji/Gotei, Shiro Shiba, Toshi Ranbo and
# its history), the Forbidden City complex, Seppun Ishikawa, the Mantis holdings,
# the ceremonial court offices (Hands of the Emperor, chancellor, advisor), the
# three named wars, and the Fortunes of war.

CODEX "L5R5e_Codex_EE_Governance" {
    NAME "Emerald Empire: Strongholds of Power — Lore Graph"
    VERSION "0.2"
    SPEC_VERSION "0.5"
    RELEASE_DATE "2026-09-02"
    FOR EDITION "l5r5e"
    DEPENDS_ON "L5R5e_Codex_Schema" VERSION "0.8"

